#' * `$degree()` -> `integer`
#'
#'   Degree of the polynomial; the zero polynomial has degree 0 (there is no
#'   universally-agreed convention for its "true" degree of -infinity, and 0 keeps
#'   every coefficient()/loop bound in this module well-defined).
