#' * `$add(other)` -> `Polynomial`
#'
#' * `$subtract(other)` -> `Polynomial`
#'
#' * `$multiply(other)` -> `Polynomial`
#'
#' * `$scale(factor)` -> `Polynomial`
#'
#' * `$negate()` -> `Polynomial`
