#'   - "logistic_growth":   dy/dt = r y (1 - y/K).            params = \{r=1, K=1\}, y0 size 1.
#'   - "harmonic_oscillator": (x,v), dx/dt=v, dv/dt=-omega^2 x. params = \{omega=1\}, y0 size 2.
#'   - "van_der_pol":       (x,v), dx/dt=v, dv/dt=mu(1-x^2)v-x. params = \{mu=1\}, y0 size 2.
